</ul>

<h2>Common Mistakes to Avoid</h2>
<p>The biggest mistake we see with brand storytelling apparel in South Africa is over-designing. Big logos, three fonts, every social handle crammed on the back — it reads as a uniform, not a story. Strip back. One symbol, one phrase, one colour-pop is almost always stronger than five competing elements fighting for attention.</p>
<p>The second mistake is inconsistency. If your spring drop feels like a different brand to your autumn drop, customers cannot build loyalty or recognition. Lock your visual rules early, write them down, and let creativity happen inside the guardrails rather than around them.</p>

